#: sm-ai.php
msgid "AI assistance services, independent of the provider (Anthropic Claude, OpenAI-compatible APIs): listing assistant, steel profile recognition on photos, smart search, document analysis. Encrypted API keys, quotas, monthly budget, usage and cost log. Suggestions only: weights come from the weight engine, and AI never replaces engineering. Requires SM Core."
